{"title":"2015 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 23","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Tom has twelve slips of paper which he wants to put into five cups labeled <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/2/fa2fa899f0afb05d6837885523503a2d4df434f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$E$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />. He wants the sum of the numbers on the slips in each cup to be an integer. Furthermore, he wants the five integers to be consecutive and increasing from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/2/fa2fa899f0afb05d6837885523503a2d4df434f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$E$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />. The numbers on the papers are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/4/f3407f99083b60a7d8cd5bd4dbfb553cca5bbfd6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2, 2, 2, 2.5, 2.5, 3, 3, 3, 3, 3.5, 4,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"227\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/b/0fbe18900c777778ad24c84cb3d99df7032b4fd3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4.5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"25\" height=\"14\" />. If a slip with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> goes into cup <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/2/fa2fa899f0afb05d6837885523503a2d4df434f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$E$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> and a slip with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> goes into cup <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />, then the slip with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/b/87b8245e043508c7c928c89b42f9ce38f04d720d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3.5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"25\" height=\"14\" /> must go into what cup?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/5/025f68af2f90d96e9d98e1f6924121ba40362c33.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) } A \\qquad \\textbf{(B) } B \\qquad \\textbf{(C) } C \\qquad \\textbf{(D) } D \\qquad \\textbf{(E) } E$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"380\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The numbers have a sum of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/b/d8bbe1a71b776789e4ee9cae2109881fe4df2e47.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6+5+12+4+8=35$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"185\" height=\"14\" />, which averages to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, which means <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/2/6521ad84932f05bbfa1185b24d793813c7aefc2d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A, B, C, D,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"85\" height=\"16\" /> and\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/2/fa2fa899f0afb05d6837885523503a2d4df434f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$E$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> will have the values <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/0/4e0ef0c1025eac51195a5b3b8eccdb88d0c6261d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5, 6, 7, 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"60\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, respectively. Now, it's the process of elimination: Cup <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" />\nwill have a sum of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, so putting a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/b/87b8245e043508c7c928c89b42f9ce38f04d720d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3.5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"25\" height=\"14\" /> slip in the cup will leave <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/8/4483ad8c4ba46fe74f7b477ca4b7ed00f68fb1b6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5-3.5=1.5$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"101\" height=\"13\" />; however,\nall of our slips are bigger than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/7/15788e198a53ced87268aea78fcde68a84de92c0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1.5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"25\" height=\"14\" />, so this is impossible. Cup <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> has a sum of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, but we are told that it already has a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> slip, leaving <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/f/7/af71a359c5e7cd6171f43e55b8fbbf1bd7d3ea4f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6-3=3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"76\" height=\"15\" />, which is too small for the\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/b/87b8245e043508c7c928c89b42f9ce38f04d720d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3.5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"25\" height=\"14\" /> slip. Cup <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> is a little bit trickier but still manageable. It must have a value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, so adding the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/b/87b8245e043508c7c928c89b42f9ce38f04d720d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3.5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"25\" height=\"14\" /> slip leaves room for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/b/7ab3d272034ceaa2b7409b0b72f95f0a613b1f6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7-3.5=3.5$\" width=\"101\" height=\"12\" />. This looks good at first as we have slips smaller than that, but upon closer inspection, we see that no slip fits \nexactly. And the smallest sum of two slips is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/5/2b5733221011b0d851a85797ec1362c805d3d3e1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2+2=4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"73\" height=\"13\" />, which is too big, so this case is also impossible. Cup <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/2/fa2fa899f0afb05d6837885523503a2d4df434f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$E$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> has a sum of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, but we are told it already has a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> slip. So, we\nare left with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/6/a/46a83c4f63923d53026c4605d8ab4ba07dadba4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9-2=7$\" width=\"73\" height=\"12\" />, which is identical to Cup C and thus also impossible.\nWith all other choices removed, we are left with the answer: Cup <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/6/666b1db7683d028c36caf82ad9950e3332a38e10.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}~D}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"62\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/SgEXCLfk_AU\">https://youtu.be/SgEXCLfk_AU</a>\n</p><p>~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8\" title=\"2015 AMC 8\">2015 AMC 8</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems\" title=\"2015 AMC 8 Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Answer_Key\" title=\"2015 AMC 8 Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=2015\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"2015 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 22\">Problem 22</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"2015 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 24\">Problem 24</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2015 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2015 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2015 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2015 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2015 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2015 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2015 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2015 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2015 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2015 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2015 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2015 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2015 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2015 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2015 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"2015 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"2015 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"2015 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"2015 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"2015 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"2015 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"2015 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"2015 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"2015 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 25\">25</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AMC_8_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AMC 8 Problems and Solutions\"> All AJHSME/AMC 8 Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018000202\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.047 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.068 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 271/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2272/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 132/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 7195/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   13.387      1 -total\n 59.54%    7.971      1 Template:AMC8_box\n 38.05%    5.093      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:14441:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018000202 and revision id 273754. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}